        "original_id": "5b2511b3-a9ff-5e37-a5e0-ad56e62e54ac",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Wu, Guy Ritchie, Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, André Benjamin, Anubhav Sinha, Shah Rukh Khan, Arjun Rampal, Kareena Kapoor, Armaan Verma, Shahana Goswami, Kanika Dhillon, Kamay Lau\n- Places: Hong Kong, Chinatown, London\n- Films: Revolver, Ra.One\n- Roles: actress, hitlady, director, writer\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Wu was born in Hong Kong and grew up in Chinatown, London.\n- Revolver is a 2005 British-French crime thriller film co-written and directed by Guy Ritchie.\n- Revolver stars Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, and André Benjamin.\n- Kamay Lau is a British actress best known as the failed hitlady in Revolver.\n- Ra.One is a 2011 Indian superhero film directed by Anubhav Sinha.\n- Ra.One stars Shah Rukh Khan, Arjun Rampal, Kareena Kapoor, Armaan Verma, Shahana Goswami, and Tom Wu in pivotal roles.\n- The script for Ra.One was written by Anubhav Sinha and Kanika Dhillon.\n- The idea for Ra.One originated when Anubhav Sinha saw a television commercial and then expanded the concept.",
